{"doc_id": "427784e8a916dff3faec539be3d837ac401108c7ef2376d163a1935a84cdd9f0", "extractor_version": "0.3.0", "schema_version": "1.1.0", "field": "eligibility", "status": "present", "value_ja": null, "normalized": {"items": [{"kind": "other", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "（１）岡山県物品の売買、修理等及び役務の提供の契約に係る入札参加資格審査要領（平成19年岡山県告示第332号。以下「審査要領」という。）に基づき入札参加資格を取得した者に係る事項を一般の閲覧に供したもの（以下「入札参加資格者名簿」という。）に登載されている者であること。", "text_en": "Must be registered on Okayama Prefecture's bid participation qualification roster.", "citations": ["p2_s14"]}, {"kind": "other", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "（２）入札参加資格者名簿の業務種目が「大分類９．その他」、「小分類１２．レンタル・リース類」であり、格付区分がＡであること。", "text_en": "Must be registered under business category 'Major Category 9: Other', 'Minor Category 12: Rental/Lease' with Grade A ranking.", "citations": ["p2_s15"]}, {"kind": "legal", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "（３）地方自治法施行令（昭和22年政令第16号）第167条の４第１項の規定に該当する者でないこと。", "text_en": "Must not fall under Article 167-4(1) of the Local Autonomy Act Enforcement Order.", "citations": ["p2_s16"]}, {"kind": "suspension", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "（４）審査要領に基づく入札参加の停止の措置を受けている者でないこと。", "text_en": "Must not be under suspension of bid participation.", "citations": ["p2_s17"]}, {"kind": "suspension", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "（５）岡山県物品の売買、修理等及び役務の提供の契約に係る入札参加除外等要領に基づく入札参加除外の措置を受けている者でないこと。", "text_en": "Must not be under exclusion from bid participation for goods/services contracts.", "citations": ["p2_s18"]}, {"kind": "legal", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "（６）岡山県建設工事等暴力団対策会議運営要領に基づく指名除外を受けている者でないこと。", "text_en": "Must not be excluded under the Okayama Prefecture organized crime countermeasures guidelines.", "citations": ["p2_s19"]}, {"kind": "legal", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "（７）民事再生法（平成11年法律第225号）に基づく再生手続開始の申立てがなされている者又は会社更生法（平成14年法律第154号）に基づく更生手続開始の申立てがなされている者（再生手続開始の決定又は更生手続開始の決定を受けている者を除く。）でないこと。", "text_en": "Must not be subject to petitions for civil rehabilitation or corporate reorganization proceedings.", "citations": ["p2_s20"]}, {"kind": "other", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "上記１（５）の納入業者と売買契約を締結し、上記１（４）に掲げる物品の納入代金を令和９年３月31日までに確実に支払うことができる者。", "text_en": "Must conclude a sales contract with the supplier in 1(5) and be able to reliably pay the equipment price in 1(4) by March 31, 2027.", "citations": ["p2_s21", "p2_s22"]}]}, "value_en": "Eight participation eligibility requirements covering Okayama Prefecture bid qualification roster registration, category and Grade A ranking, non-disqualification under Local Autonomy Act Enforcement Order Article 167-4(1), non-suspension, non-exclusion, non-organized-crime exclusion, non-bankruptcy/rehabilitation, and ability to pay the equipment supplier by March 31, 2027.", "citations": ["p2_s14", "p2_s15", "p2_s16", "p2_s17", "p2_s18", "p2_s19", "p2_s20", "p2_s21", "p2_s22"], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "web", "model": "gemini-web", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-web"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-l1"}], "agreement": false, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}, {"name": "citations_exist", "passed": true}, {"name": "field_applicable", "passed": true}, {"name": "value_in_citation", "passed": true}, {"name": "values_roundtrip", "passed": true}, {"name": "heading_cue", "passed": false}], "reviewed_by": "claude_code", "review_note": "accepted A; p2_s13 says all of the listed conditions must be met; A lists (1) to (7) p2_s14 to p2_s20 plus the extra condition p2_s22 (pay the equipment price by 2027-03-31, kind other). 暴力団 item is legal, 入札参加の停止 and 除外 items are suspension, per the field form. Negation kept as requirement. The heading_cue failure is only about p2_s22 sitting under a different heading (4 その他入札参加条件); it is still a participation condition. B has no valid items.", "final_state": "silver_model_reviewed", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": "web"}}
{"doc_id": "427784e8a916dff3faec539be3d837ac401108c7ef2376d163a1935a84cdd9f0", "extractor_version": "0.3.0", "schema_version": "1.1.0", "field": "unified_qualification", "status": "absent", "value_ja": null, "normalized": null, "value_en": null, "citations": [], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "web", "model": "gemini-web", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-web"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-l1"}], "agreement": false, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}], "reviewed_by": "claude_code", "review_note": "p2_s15 is the prefecture's own bidder roster (入札参加資格者名簿) with 業務種目 大分類９ 小分類12 and 格付区分 A, not the national 全省庁統一資格 that unified_qualification is defined for (field_schema.md, japanese_rules.md). I answered absent because it is a different register, but the field's purpose (first gate for most bidders) could argue for including it. Same question in F-0257 and F-0258. The guide does not cover prefectural rosters. The item is already in eligibility as kind other.", "final_state": "silver_model_reviewed", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": "custom"}}
{"doc_id": "427784e8a916dff3faec539be3d837ac401108c7ef2376d163a1935a84cdd9f0", "extractor_version": "0.3.0", "schema_version": "1.1.0", "field": "deadlines", "status": "present", "value_ja": null, "normalized": {"items": [{"kind": "question", "datetime": "2026-10-06T17:00:00+09:00", "relative_text": null, "flags": [], "citations": ["p1_s33", "p1_s34"]}, {"kind": "other", "datetime": "2026-10-06T17:00:00+09:00", "relative_text": null, "flags": [], "citations": ["p1_s37", "p1_s38"]}, {"kind": "mail_arrival", "datetime": "2026-10-13T17:00:00+09:00", "relative_text": null, "flags": [], "citations": ["p2_s4", "p2_s5"]}, {"kind": "bid_in_person", "datetime": "2026-10-14T13:30:00+09:00", "relative_text": null, "flags": [], "citations": ["p2_s3", "p3_s33"]}, {"kind": "bid_opening", "datetime": "2026-10-14T13:30:00+09:00", "relative_text": null, "flags": [], "citations": ["p2_s3", "p3_s33"]}]}, "value_en": null, "citations": ["p1_s33", "p1_s34", "p1_s37", "p1_s38", "p2_s4", "p2_s5", "p2_s3", "p3_s33"], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "web", "model": "gemini-web", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-web"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-l1"}], "agreement": false, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}, {"name": "citations_exist", "passed": true}, {"name": "field_applicable", "passed": true}, {"name": "value_in_citation", "passed": true}, {"name": "values_roundtrip", "passed": true}, {"name": "weekday_consistent", "passed": true}, {"name": "heading_cue", "passed": true}], "reviewed_by": "claude_code", "review_note": "Same events as A (question deadline p1_s34, participation application p1_s38, mail receipt p2_s5, bid and opening p2_s3 which reads 入札・開札の日時). Changes: no arrival_required flag because p2_s5 says 到着分まで, not 必着 (labeling guide, F-0064 rule; this is probably why A failed roundtrip); bid_opening added because p2_s3 names both bid and opening. B's question item cites p3_s34 which is only the venue address, so it is not used. p1_s40 (不適合通知 10-09) is the agency's notice date, not a bidder deadline, so left out.", "final_state": "silver_model_reviewed", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": "custom"}}
{"doc_id": "427784e8a916dff3faec539be3d837ac401108c7ef2376d163a1935a84cdd9f0", "extractor_version": "0.3.0", "schema_version": "1.1.0", "field": "submission_modes", "status": "present", "value_ja": "（１）入札の日時及び場所\n１）日時 令和８年10月14日（水）午後１時３０分\n２）場所 岡山市北区芳賀5301\n岡山県工業技術センター 技術交流室\n（３）郵便等による入札\n受領期限までに、郵便等（郵便又は民間事業者による信書の送達に関する法律（平成14年法律第99号）第２条第６項に規定する一般信書便事業者若しくは同条第９に規定する特定信書便事業者の提供する同条第２項に規定する信書便で、書留郵便その他これに準じる方法に限る。）により提出すること。\nなお、電話、電報、ファクシミリその他の方法による入札は認めない。", "normalized": {"modes": ["in_person", "mail"], "mail_not_allowed": false}, "value_en": "In-person bidding and registered mail/courier are allowed; telephone, telegram, fax, and other methods are not allowed.", "citations": ["p3_s32", "p3_s33", "p3_s34", "p3_s35", "p4_s7", "p4_s8", "p4_s9"], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "web", "model": "gemini-web", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-web"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-l1"}], "agreement": true, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}, {"name": "citations_exist", "passed": true}, {"name": "field_applicable", "passed": true}, {"name": "value_in_citation", "passed": true}, {"name": "values_roundtrip", "passed": true}, {"name": "heading_cue", "passed": false}], "reviewed_by": null, "review_note": null, "final_state": "silver_consensus", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": null}}
{"doc_id": "427784e8a916dff3faec539be3d837ac401108c7ef2376d163a1935a84cdd9f0", "extractor_version": "0.3.0", "schema_version": "1.1.0", "field": "bid_bond", "status": "see_other_document", "value_ja": "岡山県財務規則（昭和61年岡山県規則第８号）第131条及び第133条の規定による。", "normalized": {"ref": {"kind": "other", "text_ja": "岡山県財務規則（昭和61年岡山県規則第８号）第131条及び第133条の規定による。"}}, "value_en": "Governed by Articles 131 and 133 of the Okayama Prefectural Financial Regulations.", "citations": ["p4_s23", "p4_s24"], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "web", "model": "gemini-web", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-web"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-l1"}], "agreement": false, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}, {"name": "citations_exist", "passed": true}, {"name": "field_applicable", "passed": true}, {"name": "heading_cue", "passed": true}], "reviewed_by": "claude_code", "review_note": "accepted A; p4_s24 only says the bid bond follows Articles 131 and 133 of the prefectural financial regulations. No rate or requirement is stated, so B's required is a guess. see_other_document with ref kind other (a regulation, not the spec or bid instructions).", "final_state": "silver_model_reviewed", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": "web"}}
