{"doc_id": "427784e8a916dff3faec539be3d837ac401108c7ef2376d163a1935a84cdd9f0", "extractor_version": "0.3.0", "schema_version": "1.1.0", "field": "tax_basis", "status": "present", "value_ja": "なお、落札決定に当たっては、入札書に記載された金額に当該金額の100分の10に相当する額を加算した金額（当該金額に１円未満の端数があるときは、その端数金額を切り捨てるものとする。）をもって落札価格とするので、入札者は、消費税及び地方消費税に係る課税事業者であるか免税事業者であるかを問わず、見積もった契約金額の110分の100に相当する金額を入札書に記載すること。", "normalized": {"basis": "bid_excludes_tax"}, "value_en": "The bid price excludes consumption tax; 10% is added at award and bidders enter 100/110 of the estimated contract amount.", "citations": ["p4_s3"], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "web", "model": "gemini-web", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-web"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-l1"}], "agreement": false, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}, {"name": "citations_exist", "passed": true}, {"name": "field_applicable", "passed": true}, {"name": "value_in_citation", "passed": true}, {"name": "values_roundtrip", "passed": true}, {"name": "heading_cue", "passed": false}], "reviewed_by": "claude_code", "review_note": "accepted A; p4_s3: bid amount plus 10 percent gives the award price; bidders write 100/110 of the estimated contract amount. That is bid_excludes_tax. B's bid_includes_tax comes from p1_s15, the tax part of the existing lease price (納入価格), which is a different amount and not what is written on the bid form (p4_s2 says the bid is a monthly unit price).", "final_state": "silver_model_reviewed", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": "web"}}
