{"doc_id": "427784e8a916dff3faec539be3d837ac401108c7ef2376d163a1935a84cdd9f0", "extractor_version": "0.3.0", "schema_version": "1.1.0", "field": "required_documents", "status": "present", "value_ja": null, "normalized": {"items": [{"name_ja": "一般競争入札（条件付）参加申出書（別添5）", "name_en": "Conditional open competitive bidding participation application (Attachment 5)", "citations": ["p1_s36", "p3_s18"]}, {"name_ja": "入札書（別添6）", "name_en": "Bid form (Attachment 6)", "citations": ["p2_s1", "p2_s6", "p4_s8"]}, {"name_ja": "委任状（別添7）", "name_en": "Power of attorney (Attachment 7, when bidding by proxy)", "citations": ["p2_s2", "p4_s5"]}, {"name_ja": "暴力団の排除に係る誓約書", "name_en": "Pledge regarding exclusion of organized crime groups", "citations": ["p5_s15"]}]}, "value_en": "Conditional open competitive bidding participation application (Attachment 5), bid form (Attachment 6), power of attorney when bidding by proxy (Attachment 7), and pledge regarding exclusion of organized crime groups.", "citations": ["p1_s36", "p3_s18", "p2_s1", "p2_s6", "p4_s8", "p2_s2", "p4_s5", "p5_s15"], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "web", "model": "gemini-web", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-web"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-l1"}], "agreement": false, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}, {"name": "citations_exist", "passed": true}, {"name": "field_applicable", "passed": true}, {"name": "value_in_citation", "passed": true}, {"name": "values_roundtrip", "passed": true}, {"name": "heading_cue", "passed": false}], "reviewed_by": "claude_code", "review_note": "accepted A; Four items with a duty to submit: the participation application (別添5, p1_s36, p3_s18), the bid form (別添6, p2_s1, p2_s6, p4_s8), the power of attorney when bidding by proxy (別添7, p2_s2, p4_s5) and the pledge about organised crime groups that the winner must hand in (p5_s15). Left out on purpose: the question form (別添4, p1_s35, optional) and the 入札参加資格確認申請書 in p3_s26, which looks like wording copied from another template since this notice uses the 参加申出書. B has a citation to a sentence that does not exist.", "final_state": "silver_model_reviewed", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": "web"}}
{"doc_id": "427784e8a916dff3faec539be3d837ac401108c7ef2376d163a1935a84cdd9f0", "extractor_version": "0.3.0", "schema_version": "1.1.0", "field": "contact", "status": "present", "value_ja": "岡山県工業技術センター総務課総務班", "normalized": {"org": "岡山県", "department": "工業技術センター総務課総務班", "phone": "(086)286-9600", "email": "kougi@pref.okayama.lg.jp"}, "value_en": null, "citations": ["p2_s26", "p2_s28", "p2_s30"], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "web", "model": "gemini-web", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-web"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-l1"}], "agreement": true, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}, {"name": "citations_exist", "passed": true}, {"name": "field_applicable", "passed": true}, {"name": "value_in_citation", "passed": true}, {"name": "values_roundtrip", "passed": true}, {"name": "heading_cue", "passed": true}], "reviewed_by": "claude_code", "review_note": "Section 5 (p2_s23) is the office handling the lease contract. 工業技術センター is an internal body of the prefecture, so org 岡山県 and the centre goes in department (guide). Both candidates failed values_roundtrip, not because of wrapped lines but because the phone must be copied from the sentence: the source writes （086）286‐9600, so after the usual normalization it is (086)286-9600, not 086-286-9600. I kept the phone as the source writes it with ASCII hyphen and brackets so it passes. Fax left out.", "final_state": "silver_model_reviewed", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": "custom"}}
